123311	123412	123088	123089	the Governor	1452	" There 's nothing strange in this world , Wilson , nothing at all -- we may slave for years and get no reward , and do a trifle out of politeness and become independent . In my opinion , this mystery is unravelled . The old lady , for I knew the family , must have died immensely rich : she knew you in your full uniform , and she asked your name ; a heavy fall would have been to one so fat a most serious affair ; you saved her , and she has rewarded you handsomely . "
