141128	141131	141133	141134	Captain Wilson	166	" Well , "
141136	141292	141133	141134	Captain Wilson	166	" he had better have him : he is a faithful fellow , and will nurse him well . When you go on board , Mr Daly , desire the first lieutenant to send Mesty on shore with Mr Gascoigne 's and Mr Easy 's chests , and his own bag and hammock . Good heavens ! I would not for a thousand pounds that this accident had occurred . Poor foolish boys -- they run in couples , and if one 's in a scrape the other is sure to share it . Gentlemen , I return you many thanks for your kindness , and I must accept of your promised care for my unfortunate officers . I sail to - morrow at daylight . You will oblige me by informing their friends , the Rebieras , of their mischance , as I am sure they will contribute all they can to their comfort . "
141430	141430	141412	141412	I	0	"
