143313	143402	143254	143255	the friar	4724	" As soon as you bring the money here , you must go back to the barracks . Remain there till he is dead , and then return here . I will have all ready , and take you , as soon as it is dusk , to a monastery of our order in the mountains , where no one will think of looking for you till the affair is blown over ; and then I will find you a passage in some vessel out of the island . "
